        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6-83" value="In scope: rider-operated vehicle, local control, land/water models and test evidence. Excluded: autonomous riding and&lt;br&gt;assumed production readiness.&lt;br&gt;Software/hardware licensing and patent freedom require separate assessment. This diagram grants no certification or&lt;br&gt;freedom-to-operate conclusion." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#20364B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
